arak hound\">Thaarak Hounds</a>, like their tough skin the ability to breath deadly acid.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>Update 18: Toughness replaced by Vitality +20.<br /> Update 19: Dodge chance doubled.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817231146\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.109 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3020/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19800/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5512/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n148.22%  136.976     41 Template:IO\n100.00%   92.417      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   92.417      1 -total\n 96.83%   89.490      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 49.53%   45.770      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 48.57%   44.891      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 47.54%   43.932      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 46.51%   42.987      2 Template:InCategory\n 24.35%   22.506      6 Template:Popup\n 19.03%   17.583      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:14582-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817231146 and revision id 635273. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
